### 5. Backend Service Layer

#### [MODIFY] [OfferService.java](file:///c:/Users/stoyc/Documents/university/s8/talentflow/freelance/src/main/java/com/thesis/freelance/features/offer/service/OfferService.java)
**[createOffer(...)](file:///c:/Users/stoyc/Documents/university/s8/talentflow/freelance/src/main/java/com/thesis/freelance/features/offer/service/OfferService.java#239-309)** — after saving:
- Call `DocumentService.generateContract(offer)`
- Save `OfferContract` (freelancerSigned=true, clientSigned=false)

**[updateOfferStatus(...)](file:///c:/Users/stoyc/Documents/university/s8/talentflow/freelance/src/main/java/com/thesis/freelance/features/offer/service/OfferService.java#152-215)** — add cases:
- `ACCEPTED` → set `contract.clientSigned = true`, `contract.signedAt = now()`
- `DELIVERED` → validate freelancer is owner; set `offer.deliverableVisible = true`, `offer.deliveredAt = now()`; notify client
- `COMPLETED` → validate client is owner; generate + save `OfferReceipt` (full agreed price); notify freelancer; call `checkAndAutoCompletePosting(postingId)`
- `UNSATISFACTORY` → validate client is owner; accept `partialAmount: BigDecimal` parameter from request body; generate + save `OfferReceipt` with `settledAmount = partialAmount`, status label = "Partial Settlement"; call `checkAndAutoCompletePosting(postingId)`

**`submitDeliverables(UUID offerId, List<String> fileUrls, UUID freelancerUserId)`** — new method:
- Validates offer is ACCEPTED + user is freelancer owner
- Sets `deliverableUrls` (replaces existing list)
- Does NOT flip `deliverableVisible` yet (that happens on "Mark as Delivered")

**`checkAndAutoCompletePosting(UUID postingId)`** — new private helper:
- Loads all offers for posting with status ACCEPTED or DELIVERED
- If count == 0, meaning all resolved → set posting status to COMPLETED

#### [MODIFY] `PostingService.updateStatus(...)`
**Remove** the block at lines 276–288 that cascades `COMPLETED` to offers.
Keep the existing CLOSED logic (cancels pending offers) — that is still valid.

