## Confirmed Decisions

| # | Decision | Choice |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Deliverables placement | Separate "Your Work" section in [ViewOfferPage](file:///c:/Users/stoyc/Documents/university/s8/talentflow/freelance-ui/src/features/offers/pages/ViewOfferPage.tsx#19-314) left column |
| 2 | Posting auto-complete trigger | Any offer reaching `COMPLETED` or `UNSATISFACTORY` triggers check; posting completes when no offers remain in `ACCEPTED`/`DELIVERED` |
| 3 | Receipt for `UNSATISFACTORY` | **Partial Settlement** — client picks 0/25/50/75% or custom € via modal; receipt generated with that amount labelled "Partial Settlement" |
| 4 | Resubmit | **Removed** — freelancer deletes canceled offer and creates a new one instead |

## What's NOT changing (scope boundary)

- No dispute resolution flow for `UNSATISFACTORY` — future iteration
- No real payment processing — receipts are billing statements only
- Uploadcare already used in the codebase; same upload pattern applies

